{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然ですが、\n絶賛発売中の乃木坂46 13枚目シングル\n「今、話したい誰かがいる」の特典映像"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイプAに収録されている私の個人PVみてくれましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ヒナコはキタノ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶすっとふてくされて帰ってきて\n雑にカバンやメガネをおいて\nぬいぐるみに八つ当たりをして\nドサっとイスに座ってから\n始まる1人ミュージカル！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不機嫌な表情と声からはじまり\n徐々に1人ミュージカルが楽しくなってきて、ノリノリで笑顔で踊りだしたりと今までにない個人PVになってます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、あのPV結局\nヒナコはキタノかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコはコナイのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/08/9308562/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/08/9308562/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ、きてません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/11/08/9308562/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/